#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:5 2cea9f09992c4992aa632a7f650d3f8d
msgid "Electronic Speed Controller (ESC) Calibration"
msgstr "电子调速器（ESC）校准"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:7 2484d3f9371b4282bdd8a10b965d008b
msgid ""
"This document applies ONLY to Copter setups, not Rover or Plane. Refer to "
"those vehicles setup guides for ESC calibration"
msgstr "本文档仅适用于 Copter 设置，不适用于 Rover 或 Plane。请参阅相应飞行器的设置指南进行 ESC 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:9 0a01b1fd12594fe9b87d1f8e7933885d
msgid ""
"Electronic speed controllers are responsible for spinning the motors at the "
"speed requested by the autopilot. Most ESCs need to be calibrated so that "
"they know the minimum and maximum pwm values that the flight controller will"
" send.  This page provides instructions for calibrating ESCs."
msgstr ""
"电子调速器负责按飞控请求的速度驱动电机旋转。大多数 ESC 需要校准，以便它们知道飞控将发送的最小和最大 PWM 值。本页提供 ESC 校准说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:17 b3154f727db844e082f93f2edbfea4ec
msgid ""
"Please complete :ref:`radio calibration <common-radio-control-calibration>` "
"before performing ESC calibration."
msgstr "请在执行 ESC 校准前完成 :ref:`遥控器校准 <common-radio-control-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:21 7db2ab1126f748d0aa5f438d7cff311f
msgid "About ESC Calibration"
msgstr "关于 ESC 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:23 0c38fccaa4be4ed8abf9ec0e84081e0c
msgid ""
"ESC calibration will vary based on what brand of ESC you are using, so "
"always refer to the documentation for the brand of ESC you are using for "
"specific information (such as tones).  \"All at once\" calibration works "
"well for most ESCs, so it is good idea to attempt it first and if that fails"
" try the \"Manual ESC-by-ESC\" method."
msgstr ""
"ESC 校准因品牌不同而有所差异，因此请务必参阅所用 ESC 品牌的文档获取具体信息（如提示音）。\"一次性\"校准对大多数 ESC "
"效果良好，建议先尝试此方法，如失败再尝试\"逐个 ESC 手动\"校准方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:29 f5dc717b8e8f44d29815842a9341eba6
msgid ""
"Refer to :ref:`common-brushless-escs` for setup of the ESC protocol "
"(:ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>`) according to your type of ESC."
msgstr ""
"请参考 :ref:`common-brushless-escs` 根据您的 ESC 类型设置 ESC 协议（:ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE "
"<MOT_PWM_TYPE>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:30 218495efbbb7496aa117845fb2fb94a4
msgid ""
"Some ESCs like the DJI Opto ESCs do not require and do not support "
"calibration, so skip this page completely."
msgstr "某些 ESC（如 DJI 光耦 ESC）不需要也不支持校准，请直接跳过本页。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:31 13f6bc76ed304f689e643dd3208d59e6
msgid ""
"If you are using a digital esc protocol like DShot or are using CAN ESCs "
"then you also don't need to calibrate them, so skip this page. The section "
"at the end on ESC settings is still applicable, however."
msgstr "如果您使用 DShot 等数字 ESC 协议或 CAN ESC，则也无需校准，请跳过本页。但末尾关于 ESC 设置的章节仍然适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:32 afdbf8abfac6441099fe0155744a3503
msgid ""
"Some brands of ESC do not allow calibration and will not arm unless you "
"adjust your radio's throttle end-points so that the minimum throttle is "
"around 1000 PWM and maximum is around 2000.  Note that if you change the "
"end-points on your TX you must re-do the :ref:`Radio Calibration <common-"
"radio-control-calibration>`.  Alternatively, you may manually set the "
":ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` to 1000 and :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` to 2000."
msgstr ""
"某些品牌的 ESC 不允许校准，且除非您调整遥控器的油门端点使最小油门约为 1000 PWM、最大约为 "
"2000，否则不会解锁。注意：如果更改了发射端的端点，必须重新执行 :ref:`遥控器校准 <common-radio-control-"
"calibration>`。或者，您可以手动将 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` 设为 "
"1000，:ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX <MOT_PWM_MAX>` 设为 2000。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:33 143535854bed4f7fbff8c0ecbedb65cb
msgid ""
"Begin this procedure only after you have completed the :ref:`radio control "
"calibration <common-radio-control-calibration>` and :ref:`Connect ESCs and "
"motors <connect-escs-and-motors>` part of the :ref:`Autopilot System "
"Assembly Instructions <autopilot-assembly-instructions>`.  Next follow these"
" steps:"
msgstr ""
"仅在完成 :ref:`飞控系统组装说明 <autopilot-assembly-instructions>` 中的 :ref:`遥控器校准 "
"<common-radio-control-calibration>` 和 :ref:`连接 ESC 和电机 <connect-escs-and-"
"motors>` 步骤后，再开始此程序。然后按照以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:37 9cf7b3fa9a19448f82c913e39044c8c1
msgid "**Safety Check!**"
msgstr "**安全检查！**"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:39 80bc7f51d16d4d688e46be58c39d0184
msgid ""
"Before calibrating ESCs, please ensure that your copter has NO PROPS on it "
"and that the autopilot is NOT CONNECTED to your computer via USB and the "
"Lipo battery is disconnected."
msgstr "校准 ESC 前，请确保飞机上 **没有安装螺旋桨**，飞控 **未通过 USB 连接到电脑**，且 LiPo 电池已断开。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:52 280e8c5e4e2d4ad191c378f2ad99327e
msgid "All at once calibration"
msgstr "一次性校准"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:54 514e9996cc6341aea24a27bb40a57c36
msgid "Turn on your transmitter and put the throttle stick at maximum."
msgstr "打开遥控器，将油门摇杆推至最大。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:60 5abc625441a04659b09ffc8cf3c1b498
msgid ""
"Connect the Lipo battery.  The autopilot's red, blue and yellow LEDs will "
"light up in a cyclical pattern. This means the it's ready to go into ESC "
"calibration mode the next time you plug it in."
msgstr "连接 LiPo 电池。飞控的红、蓝、黄 LED 将循环点亮。这意味着下次插入电池时，飞控已准备好进入 ESC 校准模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:68 2c7ee308ed1f43e589b8de410a0ee825
msgid ""
"With the transmitter throttle stick still high, disconnect and reconnect the"
" battery."
msgstr "在遥控器油门摇杆仍处于最高位置时，断开并重新连接电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:79 14ff936cd2864f2bbb57beee42643dd4
msgid ""
"For Autopilots with a safety switch, push it until the LED displays solid "
"red"
msgstr "对于带有安全开关的飞控，按下安全开关直至 LED 显示常亮红色"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:80 4134208623424885baa6c65f5e8b60cf
msgid "The autopilot is now in ESC calibration mode."
msgstr "飞控现在处于 ESC 校准模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:81 01efb5315b6b44eb9f448382cb65a271
msgid ""
"Wait for your ESCs to emit the musical tone, the regular number of beeps "
"indicating your battery's cell count (i.e. 3 for 3S, 4 for 4S) and then an "
"additional two beeps to indicate that the maximum throttle has been "
"captured."
msgstr ""
"等待 ESC 发出音调提示音，然后是表示电池节数的常规蜂鸣声（例如 3S 电池响 3 声，4S 响 4 声），最后再响两声表示已捕获最大油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:85 dfb95459395d45d49d5efb5b429e5f5a
msgid "Pull the transmitter's throttle stick down to its minimum position."
msgstr "将遥控器油门摇杆拉至最低位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:91 96a084dc48ed429e8a242122590abc67
msgid ""
"The ESCs should then emit a long tone indicating that the minimum throttle "
"has been captured and the calibration is complete."
msgstr "ESC 应发出一声长鸣，表示已捕获最小油门，校准完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:93 0d496105d81d4ba5ab9bf32d173ed816
msgid ""
"If the long tone indicating successful calibration was heard, the ESCs are "
"\"live\" now and if you raise the throttle a bit they should spin. Test that"
" the motors spin by raising the throttle a bit and then lowering it again."
msgstr "如果听到了表示校准成功的长鸣音，ESC 现在已\"激活\"，稍微提高油门时应能旋转。通过稍微提高油门然后再降低来测试电机是否旋转。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:97 c5a03a0dd687416f88c05d661606d5b1
msgid ""
"Set the throttle to minimum and disconnect the battery to exit ESC-"
"calibration mode."
msgstr "将油门调至最低并断开电池以退出 ESC 校准模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:100 a3d69525467041b0903705a8129c7697
msgid "**Here is a video demonstrating the process:**"
msgstr "**以下是演示该过程的视频：**"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:106 e079ab3c83464b1fa16db94b69ebf1a1
msgid "Manual ESC-by-ESC Calibration"
msgstr "逐个 ESC 手动校准"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:108 34486553777542f08ed53a8aa10f8ad7
msgid ""
"Plug one of your ESC three-wire cables into the throttle channel of the RC "
"receiver. (This is usually channel 3.)"
msgstr "将 ESC 的三线电缆之一插入接收机的油门通道（通常是通道 3）。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:110 1f61e9fbdfbb4ab2981babb8a985bed5
msgid "Turn on the transmitter and set throttle stick to maximum (full up)."
msgstr "打开遥控器，将油门摇杆推至最大（完全向上）。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:111 522cee2e85e54fb99f2bbfe7541d569d
msgid "Connect the LiPo battery"
msgstr "连接 LiPo 电池"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:112 fab44b00c80348f6a38a5bd58ce648e1
msgid "You will hear a musical tone then two beeps."
msgstr "您将听到一段音调提示音，然后响两声。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:113 c184ccf73d2a449293ba8974e3e893b4
msgid "After the two beeps, lower the throttle stick to full down."
msgstr "两声蜂鸣后，将油门摇杆完全拉到最低。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:114 a5f3ef43f5174808b0acd145c0afe323
msgid ""
"You will then hear a number of beeps (one for each battery cell you're "
"using) and finally a single long beep indicating the end points have been "
"set and the ESC is calibrated."
msgstr "然后您将听到若干声蜂鸣（每节电池一声），最后一声长鸣表示端点已设置，ESC 校准完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:117 05073764d8ef4d15a6301f0a32ee6f97
msgid "Disconnect battery. Repeat these steps for all ESCs."
msgstr "断开电池。对所有 ESC 重复这些步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:118 8bf3c948e25a4af28516484a3b00f6c3
msgid ""
"If it appears that the ESC’s did not calibrate then the throttle channel on "
"the transmitter might need to be reversed."
msgstr "如果 ESC 似乎未能校准，则遥控器上的油门通道可能需要反向。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:120 07862bec1772463a8d82ced2e23229f8
msgid ""
"If you are still having trouble after trying these methods (for example, "
"ESCs still beep continuously) try lowering your throttle trim 50%."
msgstr "如果尝试这些方法后仍有问题（例如 ESC 持续蜂鸣），请尝试将油门微调降低 50%。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:123 1d934dba96134628a767437dcc52dbea
msgid ""
"You can also try powering your ArduPilot board via the USB first to boot it "
"up before plugging in the LiPo."
msgstr "您也可以先通过 USB 为 ArduPilot 飞控板供电将其启动，然后再接入 LiPo 电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:127 c8600897383e49c88e41495c0622bca1
msgid "Semi Automatic ESC-by-ESC Calibration"
msgstr "半自动逐个 ESC 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:129 b364a44277fa4fd1a48b8a0dba97b0a5
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot from a ground station such as the Mission Planner "
"and set the :ref:`ESC_CALIBRATION <ESC_CALIBRATION>` parameter to 3"
msgstr ""
"从 Mission Planner 等地面站连接到飞控，并将 :ref:`ESC_CALIBRATION <ESC_CALIBRATION>` "
"参数设置为 3"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:130 39bbe817111f4a118c44d3dcdb861fc0
msgid "Disconnect the battery and USB cable so the autopilot powers down"
msgstr "断开电池和 USB 线缆，使飞控断电"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:131 97f557b959864739b3419f06e050ce07
msgid "Connect the battery"
msgstr "连接电池"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:132 eaedb419fd81474c806361812d2da558
msgid "The arming tone will be played (if the vehicle has a buzzer attached)"
msgstr "将播放解锁音调（如果飞行器连接了蜂鸣器）"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:133 3f9e2f002463497d8ead3b09242fab96
msgid ""
"If using an autopilot with a safety button (like the Pixhawk) press it until"
" it displays solid red"
msgstr "如果使用带安全按钮的飞控（如 Pixhawk），按下安全按钮直至显示常亮红色"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:134 90ca6ec545d14e369dae434125d11bab
msgid "You will hear a musical tone then two beeps"
msgstr "您将听到音调提示音，然后响两声"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:135 67abc99f04224498b6121958167fb2bf
msgid ""
"A few seconds later you should hear a number of beeps (one for each battery "
"cell you're using) and finally a single long beep indicating the end points "
"have been set and the ESC is calibrated"
msgstr "几秒钟后，您应听到若干声蜂鸣（每节电池一声），最后一声长鸣表示端点已设置，ESC 校准完成"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:136 8b523c20f01c4d85bbc90b39323a7614
msgid ""
"Disconnect the battery and power up again normally and test as described "
"below"
msgstr "断开电池，重新正常上电并按以下说明进行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:139 e5ade9bebd204af49238a4dadbd6338b
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:141 b89eb0836bfe4447af4c71ae42cdfcdd
msgid ""
"Once you have calibrated your ESCs, you can test them by plugging in your "
"LiPo.  Remember: no propellers!"
msgstr "校准完 ESC 后，可以插上 LiPo 电池进行测试。记住：不要安装螺旋桨！"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:144 2c9cd40227794ff5b4f016f702ee88f5
msgid ""
"Ensure your transmitter's flight mode switch is set to “Stabilize Mode”."
msgstr "确保遥控器的飞行模式开关设置为\"Stabilize 模式\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:146 2f8a16bda49449099889d350c63e2fd3
msgid ":ref:`Arm your copter <arming_the_motors>`"
msgstr ":ref:`解锁飞机 <arming_the_motors>`"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:147 b6eb4f921980466bb4ccd687ba91ccb1
msgid ""
"Give a small amount of throttle.  All motors should spin at about same speed"
" and they should start at the same time. If the motors do not all start at "
"the same time and spin at the same speed, the ESC’s are still not properly "
"calibrated."
msgstr "施加少量油门。所有电机应以大致相同的转速旋转，并同时启动。如果电机不能同时启动且转速相同，则 ESC 仍未正确校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:151 135b89dceab4492ab848d2a30453c5ae
msgid "Disarm your copter"
msgstr "上锁飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:154 8a609637012d497cac12f246f7bc3122
msgid "Notes / Troubleshooting"
msgstr "注意事项/故障排除"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:156 81f98267c4324af4bf02272fbdc15440
msgid ""
"The All-at-once ESC calibration mode simply causes the autopilot to pass "
"through the pilot's throttle directly through to the ESCs. If you power up "
"the autopilot while in this mode you’ll send the same PWM signal to all the "
"ESCs. That's all it does.  Many ESCs use full throttle at startup to enter "
"programming mode, full throttle position is then saved as the upper end "
"point and when you pull the throttle down to zero, that position is saved as"
" the lower end point."
msgstr ""
"一次性电调校准模式只是让飞控将飞手的油门直接透传到电调。如果在此模式下给飞控上电，你会向所有电调发送相同的 PWM "
"信号，仅此而已。许多电调在启动时用全油门进入编程模式，此时全油门位置被保存为上端点，当你把油门拉到零时，该位置被保存为下端点。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:164 b324e93b20974e67b21eb7ec208fc863
msgid ""
"If after calibration your motors do NOT spin same speed nor start at the "
"same time, repeat the calibration process. If you tried the auto calibration"
" above and it didn’t work or the ESCs do not drive the motors identically, "
"try the manual calibration method described above. That should work almost "
"every time. (Rarely after a full manual calibration you will also need to do"
" an additional final automatic calibration)."
msgstr ""
"如果校准后电机转速不一致或未同时启动，请重复校准过程。如果尝试了自动校准但未成功，或 ESC "
"驱动电机不一致，请尝试上述手动校准方法，几乎每次都能奏效。（极少数情况下，完成全手动校准后还需额外进行一次自动校准）。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:171 69b8915984aa42f59e326432ddbc9a1c
msgid ""
"Finally, there are a huge number of brands and types of ESCs available and "
"some of them do not adhere to the normal programming conventions (sometimes "
"even though they claim to) and they may simply not work with ArduPilot the "
"way it is now. This is an unfortunately necessary but true disclaimer."
msgstr ""
"最后，市面上有大量品牌和型号的 ESC，其中一些不遵循正常的编程规范（有时即使声称兼容也如此），它们可能就是无法与 ArduPilot "
"兼容。这是一个不得不提但属实的免责声明。"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:178 04b8babc34d04c56b38a2d96f3ddc462
msgid "Recommended ESC settings as follows:"
msgstr "推荐的 ESC 设置如下："

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:180 67dd2955744c44d7a10a9d73a09206db
msgid "Brake on stop: OFF"
msgstr "停止时制动：关闭"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:181 706362bafb1d485996a6544396d5b105
msgid ""
"Active braking/\"Damped light\": ON (Also known as \"Non Damped mode\" set "
"to OFF)"
msgstr "主动制动/\"阻尼轻载\"：开启（也称为\"非阻尼模式\"设置为关闭）"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:182 99f89a12dbec49a1816b9281069049ef
msgid ""
"Low voltage protection: OFF (alternatively, you can set battery type to Ni-"
"xx(NiMH or NiCd) (even if you're using Li-po batteries because this setting "
"reduces the likelihood that the ESC's low voltage detection will turn off "
"the motors)"
msgstr ""
"低压保护：关闭（或者，您可以将电池类型设置为 Ni-xx（NiMH 或 NiCd）（即使使用 Li-po 电池，因为此设置降低了 ESC "
"低压检测关闭电机的可能性）"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:186 ea6cc1878e9a493cbb7c924b96f082bf
msgid "CutOff Mode: Soft-Cut (Default)"
msgstr "断电模式：软断电（默认）"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:187 a10c19e5e1044ddabbd8b1373a552b49
msgid "CutOff Threshold: Low"
msgstr "断电阈值：低"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:188 225b204c754e441fa747b98214f61ceb
msgid "Start Mode: Normal (Default)"
msgstr "启动模式：正常（默认）"

#: ../../source/docs/esc-calibration.rst:189 eb0f5723d13b40d48a3c46ed3c2fed6f
msgid "Timing: MEDIUM"
msgstr "换相时序：中"
